title: "The Amazing Race Dataset & AI Training Corpus"
abstract: "A comprehensive tidy dataset and AI training corpus for the CBS reality competition television series The Amazing Race, covering 36 seasons across relational tables, SQLite database, and multi-turn instruction-tuning corpora."
